extends layout

block content
  h1 About
  p.subtitle COMP 4601 Lab 1 — Basic RESTful Store Manager

  h2(style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;margin:16px 0 8px 0")
    | How to use (basic operations)

  ul
    li Products page: click “Products” on top to view all products.
    li View product detail: go to /products/:id (HTML) or request JSON with Accept header.
    li Add review: POST /products/:id/reviews with JSON { "rating": 1..10 }.
    li View reviews: /products/:id/reviews (HTML or JSON).

  p.small Note: The server does not persist data. Restarting the server resets products to the initial state from products.json.
